// Qadav Grid World Environment (8x8)
// 64 discrete states: (x, y) in [0, 7] x [0, 7]
// Actions: 0=UP, 1=DOWN, 2=LEFT, 3=RIGHT
// Reward: +1.0 on reaching goal (7, 7), -0.01 per step

network EnvGridSpec ⟦
    dense ⟬64⸴ 128⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬128⸴ 4⟭ ·
⟧

process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    emit "ENV_GRID_8X8_INITIALIZED" ·
    yield 0 ·
⟧

